and address, these aspects."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hundrastgård är en särskilt avsedd rastplats för hund eller annat husdjur för att kunna rastas fritt utan koppel, när inhägnad kring ytan finns. Hundrastgårdar kan se väldigt olika ut och specifikationen avser att beskriva, förutom det uppenbara gällande hundrastgårdens placering och adress, dessa egenskaper."}],"dct:identifier":"dog-park","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-17T09:00:00.000Z"},"dct:language":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"}],"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-17T09:05:00.000Z"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120001702"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:0a62a73c94e9057758e432e8288ad3a5e0b1df965b4f32d40c16b43c2f6fc0ba_b3n0"},{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2678205"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:0a62a73c94e9057758e432e8288ad3a5e0b1df965b4f32d40c16b43c2f6fc0ba_b4n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Dog parks"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hundrastgårdar"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#versionNotes":{"@language":"en","@value":"Initial release"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#qualifiedAttribution":{"@id":"_:0a62a73c94e9057758e432e8288ad3a5e0b1df965b4f32d40c16b43c2f6fc0ba_b5n0"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.skara.se/store/1/resource/90","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:format":"text/csv","dct:title":"hundrastgardar_skara.csv"},{"@id":"https://catalog.skara.se/store/1/resource/91","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.skara.se/store/1/resource/90"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"2639"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.skara.se/store/1/resource/90"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/specifications/hundrastgardar/1.0"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"de","@value":"CSV-Darstellung nach Spezifikation, bei der jede Zeile einen Hundauslauf r