0","@type":"dct:ProvenanceStatement","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Skara Municipality measures surface water temperatures (approximately 30–50 centimetres below the surface) at three popular swimming lakes, using IoT sensors from Dragino which transmit data via the mobile network (NB-IoT) to our data platform, where we then make this data available for external viewing (www.skara.se) and as an open dataset."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skara kommun mäter ytvattentemperaturer (cirka 30-50 centimeter under ytan) vid tre popluära badsjöar, med hjälp av IoT-sensorer från Dragino som via mobilnätet (NB-IoT) sänder data till vår dataplattform, där vi sedan gör denna data tillgänglig för extern visning (www.skara.se) och som öppen datamängd."}]},{"@id":"_:16997ee3d9d2aacd736fdaea022a6de2a5b7cca7bbfef7e56c7ba26820ec4588_b1n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((13.16 58.46,13.76 58.46,13.76 58.275,13.16 58.275,13.16 58.46))"}},{"@id":"_:16997ee3d9d2aacd736fdaea022a6de2a5b7cca7bbfef7e56c7ba26820ec4588_b2n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-07-01"}},{"@id":"_:16997ee3d9d2aacd736fdaea022a6de2a5b7cca7bbfef7e56c7ba26820ec4588_b3n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#country-name":"Sverige","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":"Skara","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":"532 88","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Skara Stadshus"},{"@id":"_:16997ee3d9d2aacd736fdaea022a6de2a5b7cca7bbfef7e56c7ba26820ec4588_b4n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Voice","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4651132000"}},{"@id":"_:16997ee3d9d2aacd736fdaea022a6de2a5b7cca7bbfef7e56c7ba26820ec4588_b5n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:0511-32000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120001702","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier"